# Completing a project in the outline pane removes its overdue tasks from Overdue in the other pane.
file <<END
Launch:
	- Book venue @due({today-2})
	- Send invites @due({today-1})
Other:
	- Fix sink @due({today-1})
END
keys gO <C-w> s
see │  󰨱 Overdue
keys g1 gh gg x
see │  - Fix sink  Other
hide Book venue  Launch
hide Send invites  Launch
quit
saved <<END
Launch: @done({today})
	- Book venue @due({today-2})
	- Send invites @due({today-1})
Other:
	- Fix sink @due({today-1})
END
